{"parse": {"title": "深空波-05", "pageid": 88945, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E6%B3%A2-04\" title=\"深空波-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">深空波-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B7%B1%E7%A9%BA%E6%B3%A2-06\" title=\"深空波-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">深空波</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.95.BF.E5.81.87.E5.B0.86.E5.B0.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"长假将尽\">长假将尽</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 长假将尽</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">No More Idleness</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十数个月过去。<br />——又或是数十个月？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除了更换过一间更加宽敞整洁的房间之外，乌尔里希在普列谢茨克的假期没有发生太大变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那台被遗弃了数年的示波器，被它安置在了新房间。<br />仪器一旁摆放着一杯凉掉一半的咖啡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它熟练地按下按钮，拧动一些调节器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>今天又在想什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"121\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“示波器”：</div><div>哔——哔哔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过去的相处中，乌尔里希已经完全了解了示波器外部按钮的操作方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只不过它从来没想过要拆开外壳，探寻内部构造。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>近期没有新的信息产生，只能重复回调一些历史记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>但我已经编译出历史波形中所有高频次出现的模式，剩下的问题在于一些难以归纳的乱码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这些乱码或许需要更大量的新样本才能得以解析……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体从桌面上拿起一份读过多遍的讲稿，它来自于分部负责人路德维希的一次有关语言学的讲座。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>讲稿中的某些内容似乎能对示波器信号破解带来帮助，当然，也可能将它引入歧途……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">演讲稿：</div><div>“语言规律，包括语法和词汇-概念映射的模式，大多基于社会性共识而确立，也就是通常所说的‘约定俗成’……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">演讲稿：</div><div>“混乱和随机性是自然语言的基本特质之一，同样的，语言还有狭隘性和片面性……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">演讲稿：</div><div>“这意味着，语言的效用局限在语言使用者的认识水平之内……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……规律性和混乱性共存，示波器的信号模式符合路德维希先生所说的语言特征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>同时，过去的多次实验已经证明，示波器不会对环境变量产生反馈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它竭力避免回忆起尴尬的实验过程——举着示波器在设施内游走，并遭受着看待异类的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>也就是说，它并非某种监测设备，而是在自主发出信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>但现有的样本丰富性无法让我进一步验证猜想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咚——咚——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵随性的敲门声响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嘿，老友，在里面吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为一名常年在野外勘探的学者，她的到来很不寻常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>北方哨歌？——请进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理线学家推门而入，随后将一些干酪和极地鱼子酱放在桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>感谢你的慷慨，可这些食物我用不上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>好吧，那我把它们留给和我有利益相关的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赠礼人很干脆地收回了礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>示波器有进展吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>没有任何实质性的进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你回分部休整吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌的眼中闪出讶异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不，“暴雨”要来了。我是来躲雨的。<br />你应该也已经收到警报了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希似乎需要花很长时间才能领悟到这场世界性灾难的紧迫性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>噢……是的，没错……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体再度沉闷下去，它似乎已经丧失了对待事物的基本反应力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——嘿，乌尔里希！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你怎么一声不吭？到底在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>还有十二个小时不到，外部世界就要遭遇回溯，你在这个时代还有落下的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被问询的一方继续沉默着，没有想好应对的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"121\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“示波器”：</div><div>“哔哔——哔……哔……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>那“暴雨”之后呢？——你是否打算结束假期，回到总部？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"121\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“示波器”：</div><div>“哔——哔哔——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>它太吵了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它打算将示波器关闭，反倒被北方哨歌制止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>让它开着吧，不然这里就太安静了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我在北极圈附近的考察活动不得不收尾了，这次“暴雨”结束之后，我会回一趟总部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我要整理一下目前收集到的资料，顺便开一场针对其他专业人士的理线学讲座。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>如果你也准备离开，我们可以顺路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我还没有决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>也许我已经习惯这种没有人打扰的生活，这有助于我安静地思考有关时代和“暴雨”的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>——可你甚至都没注意到下一场“暴雨”就要来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌吹出一道音调促狭的口哨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这可不太好，乌尔里希，漫长的假期已经让你精疲力尽了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你该回到总部去做些真正的工作恢复状态——同时，别忘了给你的组员带一些久别重逢的礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"121\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“示波器”：</div><div>“哔哔……哔哔……哔哔……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你也同意我的话吗，小家伙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出人意料，示波器对北方哨歌的发言予以更加激烈的回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"523401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"523401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-523401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-523401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"121\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“示波器”：</div><div>“哔哔！哔哔！哔哔！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>什……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希埋头紧盯显示界面，磁流体的形状也跟随着频率而颤动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……现在的频率……不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它从桌上拿起笔记，飞速检索着过去记录的历史数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>2月的记录……不，10月的——在这，也完全对不上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌也条件反射般地抽出铅笔和笔记本，但随后发现自己根本没有可以记录的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>发现问题了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>所有信号的幅度全都在增强，新波形的谷峰值几乎要突破仪器显示上限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>规律性受损了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>正是如此，常见的规律性图式出现概率极速降低，信息的混乱性正在剧增。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>难道真的是因为我们说的话……不对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>它没理由回应我们说的话，我从来不觉得这台示波器真的是一个意识唤醒者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>就连我都已经差不多放弃这个猜想了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>那真是再好不过——可现在这又是怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>有什么条件被改变了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体猛地抬起头，长久地展现为一个惊叹号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——“暴雨”在对它产生直接的影响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……我的假期该结束了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "深空波-05"}}